.venv/
build/

# Regenerable pre-review snapshots. `sensitive.jsonl` and
# retrieval_labels.jsonl are the committed, human-reviewed artifacts; the
# draft/proposed files these two names would otherwise write are a scripted
# generator's transient output, not kept in the repo once review is done —
# `python scripts/generate_eval_questions.py [--labels]` recreates them
# locally any time a fresh one is wanted, e.g. after new sensitive Scenarios
# are added.
eval/sensitive_draft.jsonl
eval/retrieval_labels_proposed.jsonl
# The judge hand-label template: `python scripts/select_judge_sample.py`
# regenerates it locally any time the answered set changes. A person's
# completed copy is what gets committed, as `eval/judge_hand_labels.jsonl`.
eval/judge_hand_labels_template.jsonl
